        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "This review is more than deserved! As a realtor I referred LFG to many customers, and never have I had a bad feed back! In fact, I’ve only got praises from my clients! would recommend them to anyone!",
        "time": 1742591032,
