        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKQJRe2_Nxz9yO4DGhDVl5V2LGcmsjQYB55n9uWvACnsE6c0A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Very satisfied with my experience with LFG Transport. I used this company for their moving service and was impressed by their prompt and courteous service. They were very attentive to my instructions regarding the placement of furniture in my new home and made sure to pack my belongings well during transport from point A to point B. I would not hesitate to use their services in the future!",
